    "body": "The Eclipse Keyple project intends change the licence of this repository from EPL-2.0 to MIT. The aim is to offer more permissiveness on extension development and example reuse, as [presented to the Eclipse Foundation's EMO team in this discussion](https://gitlab.eclipse.org/eclipsefdn/emo-team/emo/-/issues/908).\n\nIn order to accomplish this, we need the approval of all copyright holders. We hereby kindly ask all of the copyright holders to indicate their approval by commenting on this issue with +1.\n🙏🏼 @AlexandreMunsch , @jeanpierrefortune , @andrei-cristea ",
